<title>HONG KONG: Citibank sets warrants on Pearl Oriental.</title>
<headline>Citibank sets warrants on Pearl Oriental.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Citibank, N.A., Hong Kong Branch, said it intended to issue 120 million American style call warrants on shares of Pearl Oriental Holdings Ltd.</p>
<p>One warrant controls one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	HK$3.135     PREMIUM	 25.76 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$0.449     GEARING	 6.34X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  05.SEPT.97   PAYDATE	 3 WKS AFTER LAUNCH</p>
<p> LISTING	     HONG KONG    MIN EXER LOT  2,000</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE    HK$2.85</p>
<p> NOTES		 GOVERNING LAW IS HONG KONG</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
